// Assignment and mutation comprehensive test suite.
//
// Exercises the parse_expr_or_assign_stmt path in the statement parser,
// verifying that tk_precedence(Eq) == 0 so `=` is handled as assignment,
// not consumed as an infix operator by the Pratt parser.
//
